	)
	(text "TWEETER BRANCH - Dayton RST28F-4 (4 ohm)"
		(at 38.1 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cff455a1-f192-4fb2-bebb-38c23bc55ede")
	)
	(text "WOOFER BRANCH - Dayton RS180P-8 (8 ohm)"
		(at 38.1 92.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cf698d83-496d-4b56-a2d9-9db36fc8f181")
	)
	(text "IN from Fosi V3 amplifier"
		(at 12.7 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7dfc5de4-8877-4810-846a-dd4d423304ea")
	)
	(text "(TPA3255, 48 V rail)"
		(at 12.7 68.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bdcef849-b5d7-40f7-a050-b7aa441534a6")
	)
	(text "series tank in the branch, not a shunt"
		(at 45.72 60.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aba085d0-fc9a-4f1e-a04d-de2f7310037c")
	)
	(text "series tank in the branch, not a shunt"
		(at 121.92 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0d6b8b94-74d2-4619-abe8-4b3fd760401f")
	)
	(text "NOTES  -  one board per speaker, build two.   Value field = DTU component shop part number."
		(at 12.7 146.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "728a9194-3cd5-4bde-8ed4-f6e3942dbf92")
	)
	(text "1. GND = IN- , the amplifier's negative speaker terminal and the common return for both drivers."
		(at 12.7 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bed77ffc-3e17-4388-aa08-fc87e609287e")
	)
	(text "   It is NOT chassis earth, and the two boards' returns must not be tied to each other."
		(at 12.7 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d15312a0-ca6b-4479-8fe7-adf684a7996c")
	)
	(text "2. All capacitors are FILM and must be rated >= 63 V, 100 V preferred. The shop lists no voltage"
		(at 12.7 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "46fb035b-ef85-4c36-b6cb-80ebdc855d89")
	)
	(text "   rating, so CHECK THE PRINTING ON THE ACTUAL PARTS before fitting them."
		(at 12.7 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "96313d51-20bf-457a-8bd9-d5ae78167e79")
	)
	(text "3. Series pairs:   R101+R102 = 9.4 ohm / 10 W (design 10 ohm).   R201+R202 = 20 ohm / 10 W (20)."
		(at 12.7 166.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c380576a-fee8-4e0a-9afa-e2b34d9926da")
	)
	(text "4. Parallel caps:  C102||C103 = 5.5uF (5.6).  C104||C105 = 10.1uF (10).  C201..C205 = 41uF (40)."
		(at 12.7 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7af5c2ca-64db-4bb5-a79d-e0f80d32626f")
	)
	(text "                   C206||C207 = 11.5uF (12).  Each part's 'Design value' field holds the original."
		(at 12.7 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b5092f7a-cf9f-4f62-9721-2cc6d65fd13b")
	)
	(text "5. L101/L102/L201/L202 are BOUGHT air-core coils, 0.8 mm (20 AWG) wire - not shop stock. Dayton"
		(at 12.7 179.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e478c88c-b576-46b6-a495-371fd5db6571")
	)
	(text "   AC20-20 / AC20-25 / AC20-70 / AC202 or Jantzen Audio equivalents. Target DCR is in Description."
		(at 12.7 184.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "40233e51-1e91-4d2e-88f4-3e708089b053")
	)
	(text "6. FOOTPRINTS ARE PROVISIONAL: measure cap lead pitch and coil diameter before placement."
		(at 12.7 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b9b9eb4c-4ca1-475b-98a2-a7200a738d84")
	)
	(text "7. Single-sided board, CNC isolation-milled with a 0.8 mm end mill. Through-hole only."
		(at 12.7 191.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7e62d450-f55f-4331-b272-c358d251d053")
	)
